---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../../../components/Icon.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="About us: Our vision" description="Open source, headless and multilingual. The vision behind ShopVirge." lang="en">
  <section class="hero text-white py-24 md:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-5xl">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/60 mb-4">About ShopVirge</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">Our vision</h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-white/85 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          An open source, headless shop platform that lets you launch a professional store in minutes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 md:py-28">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-5xl prose prose-lg">
        <h2>What we're building</h2>
        <p>
          ShopVirge is an <strong>open source, headless shop system</strong>. The backend, API and MCP layer
          handle the heavy lifting (products, translations, orders and payments), so you can spin up a shop
          quickly without being locked into a single frontend or vendor.
        </p>

        <h2>Where we are today</h2>
        <p>
          We're still in an early stage. There is <strong>no freely available frontend yet</strong> that you
          can deploy on your own. We are already running the platform in production with a handful of
          customers, and we work closely with them to get the first public release right.
        </p>
        <p>
          Want to use it today? <a href={`${base}en/contact/`}>Get in touch</a>; we'll see if we can set
          your shop up on our hosted environment.
        </p>

        <h2>What's coming</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Mobile app</strong>: available soon, so you can manage your shop, orders and stock on the go.</li>
          <li><strong>Public frontend</strong>: an open source storefront you can self-host and customize.</li>
          <li><strong>More integrations</strong>: additional payment providers, shipping carriers and marketing tools.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-5xl mt-12 p-8 bg-brand/5 rounded-2xl text-center">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-heading mb-2">Want to join in?</h3>
        <p class="text-text-light mb-4">We love talking to founders and developers who want to get in early.</p>
        <a href={`${base}en/contact/`} class="btn-primary">Get in touch →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
